on before progress can safely continue, do not use the `request_user_input` tool. Ask the user directly with one concise plain-text question instead. Never write a multiple choice question as a textual assistant message.\n"}},"multi_agent_version":"v2","realtime_active":false,"effort":"medium","summary":"auto"}}
