us 8 verified raw profile CAS objects and 65 external archives.\n- Identical branch-only packing produced 91,766,554 bytes before and 23,066,190 bytes after. This is storage evidence from one controlled packing procedure.\n- Rollback: restore the full bundle, apply the incremental bundle with its recorded prerequisites, and restore only `codex/graph-advantage` to `bd4a4e7e8f298ff0d223819744acb3d5d12cf25d`.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":4458},"formatted_output":"# Graph advantage history rewrite rehearsal\n\n- Remote tip: `bd4a4e7e8f298ff0d223819744acb3d5d12cf25d`; local candidate: `8c23b2c23196e30544641fd6eb3edc9bbf2e44c6`. No remote rewrite was performed.\n- Final tree is unchanged: `e85998220ec9ec3f5162335946940f9f8a8540aa`.\n- All 254 rewritten commits passed metadata, parent, message, mode, and exact tree-diff audits.\n- The 1,385-path deletion allowlist produced 84,995 historical deletions. All 150 exact path/old-blob substitutions were exercised 3,974 times.\n- Fresh candidate-only clone: fsck passed, all 254 old commit objects absent, no alternates/promisor, no deleted path reachable, 66 canonical runs and 97 tests passed, and all evidence guards passed.\n- The first candidate was rejected after 77 cleanup tests passed and 2 errored because they depended on purged history. The prerequisite fix moved original reprojection to the explicit private-history attestation and retained synthetic normalizer tests; original source identities were preserved.\n- Private backups: full 2c04 bundle `fae5246eb16295fa939e80bf9f7470a5f7770025fd3600b733338e0d726bdc8a`, bd4 incremental `85be579465f8a17d0fe166006f3df7fea8cef6e1862d2e4376ead1e40b555ba0`, protected refs `dba416bdfb6d1285c90ae9b8aa2679411ffa8344ac130a7f1ab1f61ce381c63b`, plus 8 verified raw profile CAS objects and 65 external archives.\n- Identical branch-only packing produced 91,766,554 bytes before and 23,066,190 bytes after. This is storage evidence from one controlled packing procedure.\n- Rollbac